Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Agent session state
.pi/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The private planning corpus.
#
# docs/planning/ states the architecture, the refusals, the delivery roadmap
# and the economics of this project. It is excluded from every public
# repository so that a consumer of the code cannot read the reasoning,
# the rejected alternatives or the business assumptions behind it.
#
# Consequence, and it is deliberate: nothing committed to this repository may
# link into docs/planning/. AGENTS.md and every README are written to stand
# alone for exactly this reason. A link into an excluded directory is a link
# that 404s for every person who ever clones this repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/docs/planning/
